{"unit_id":"ericshang98__Perfect-Web-Clone#feature-capture","repo":"ericshang98/Perfect-Web-Clone","commit":"c846c37937a70497d37d082c26c85aa1289a9fa5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Perfect Web Clone 的功能「网页采集」：使用 pwc_extract 工具或 pwc extract 命令渲染给定 URL，采集页面 DOM、样式和截图等可复用证据，并返回 source_id 与摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.js:56"]}
