{"unit_id":"ericshang98__Perfect-Web-Clone#feature-assembly","repo":"ericshang98/Perfect-Web-Clone","commit":"c846c37937a70497d37d082c26c85aa1289a9fa5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Perfect Web Clone 的功能「项目组装」：根据 source_id 和区块计划写出 Vite + React 项目外壳；组件由 agent 编写，组装器负责组织共享项目文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["mcp_server/tools/build_deploy.py:105"]}
{"unit_id":"ericshang98__Perfect-Web-Clone#feature-visual-score","repo":"ericshang98/Perfect-Web-Clone","commit":"c846c37937a70497d37d082c26c85aa1289a9fa5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Perfect Web Clone 的功能「截图相似度检查」：提供参考图与候选图路径，计算 SSIM 相似度并报告分区差异；可按页面区块边界分别评分。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/gates/fidelity.py:51"]}
